#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:10002
#: e2a6abfc7ab549eaa8cebc596da31f4b
msgid "Control Analysis: Discretization Basics"
msgstr "制御解析: 離散化の基礎"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:20002
#: 401ebab8573c4f468e844af66e557bb3
msgid ""
"This notebook promotes the legacy control-theory example into the public "
"docs set. The point is not just to call `c2d()`: it is to show how a "
"continuous plant changes when a digital controller samples and holds "
"actuator commands."
msgstr ""
"この notebook は legacy の制御理論例を公開 docs 用に整理したものです。ここで見たいのは `c2d()` "
"の使い方そのものではなく、**連続時間プラントがデジタル実装でどう見え方を変えるか** です。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:20004
#: 44d724cca38045a2ad69c165dd94b35b
msgid ""
"We compare **Zero-Order Hold (ZOH)** and **Tustin** because they preserve "
"different physical aspects of the loop. ZOH is faithful to DAC-held commands"
" in time-domain actuation, while Tustin tends to preserve frequency response"
" near crossover more evenly."
msgstr ""
"**Zero-Order Hold (ZOH)** は DAC が指令をサンプル間で保持するという物理モデルに対応し、**Tustin** "
"は周波数応答の形を比較的よく保ちます。どちらを使うかで時間応答と位相余裕の見え方が変わります。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:40002
#: 1b5bff647d5e491cbef897313a61299b
msgid "1. Discretize the plant"
msgstr "1\\. プラントを離散化する"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:40004
#: fb501a3850d8430f9cac512b0832d444
msgid ""
"Sampling does two things at once: it freezes actuator commands between "
"updates and it warps the frequency axis seen by the digital filter. Those "
"are different physical approximations, so we keep both versions."
msgstr ""
"サンプリングは「指令を保持する」という近似と、「周波数軸を写像する」という近似を同時に導入します。制御系ではこの 2 つを混同しないことが重要です。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:60002
#: 71c3951afba9473c99ff2fc9d83626d8
msgid "2. Compare frequency response"
msgstr "2\\. 周波数応答を比べる"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:60004
#: 396bb69b5beb490a9d04ae9fe10671c9
msgid ""
"The physically important question is where phase and gain begin to drift "
"away from the continuous plant. Excess phase error near the intended unity-"
"gain region directly changes stability margin."
msgstr "制御的に重要なのは、位相とゲインが連続系からどこでずれ始めるかです。とくに位相誤差は安定余裕を直接変えます。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:80002
#: 8aa8d3735ae94a6eb4a75e88716a2d52
msgid "3. Compare time response"
msgstr "3\\. 時間応答を比べる"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_discretization.ipynb:80004
#: 9344b366f25a47b5a597d3d7b6fa9b27
msgid ""
"Time-domain comparisons reveal the other half of the story: ZOH reproduces "
"held actuator commands naturally, while Tustin may look better in loop-shape"
" analysis but can misrepresent the exact held-input waveform."
msgstr ""
"時間領域では ZOH が「保持された指令」を自然に再現し、Tustin は loop shape "
"には有利でも保持入力の忠実度は別問題であることが見えてきます。"
